  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This has been an issue for a looooong time. Sometimes it's just extremely difficult to target someone and click on them to access the quick menu, because you'll just click them over and over again while pointing at them, and the quick menu simply will not open up no matter how many times you keep pointing and clicking on the person.\nA lot of people thought this was because of FPS drop below a certain number like 20fps, but I will get this issue a lot of times with 40-50fps or more.\nA fix to this issue would be much appreciated. Thanks.",
